          "briefTitle": "Evaluation of the Effects of Laughter Yoga",
          "officialTitle": "Evaluation of the Effects of Laughter Yoga on Pain Intensity, Stress, and Beta-endorphin Levels in Patients With Multiple Sclerosis"
        },
        "statusModule": {
