          "briefTitle": "Running Title: Walking to Music and in Silence on a Treadmill",
          "officialTitle": "The Effect of a 4 Week Auditory-motor Coupling Intervention on Walking, Information Processing Speed and Fatigue in Persons With Multiple Sclerosis: Three Armed Pilot Intervention"
        },
        "statusModule": {
