          },
          "briefTitle": "Dose-Ranging Efficacy and Safety Study of Topical Rapamycin Cream for Facial Angiofibroma Associated With Tuberous Sclerosis Complex",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase 2/3, Multi-Center, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Randomized, Parallel-Group, Dose-Response Comparison of the Efficacy and Safety of a Topical Rapamycin Cream for the Treatment of Facial Angiofibromas (FA) Associated With Tuberous Sclerosis Complex (TSC) in Patients 6 Years of Age and Over"
        },
        "statusModule": {
