            "interventionModelDescription": "This will be an open label, single arm, single center phase 1 research study designed to generate safety data, biomarker data, and preliminary efficacy data to reduce fatigue in patients with progressive MS, to include PPMS and SPMS",
            "primaryPurpose": "TREATMENT",
