The trial began in February 2019 and completed its primary phase on April 10, 2021. While it's not specifically a malaria study, it does include Plasmodium Falciparum Malaria as one of the conditions being studied alongside bacterial pneumonia and viral infections.

For the Dogecoin price analysis during this period, I'll need to calculate the coefficient of variation for daily closing prices from April 4-10, 2021 (using Sunday as the first day). Let me fetch that data next."}]

